{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"live uv unwrapping in blender live uv unwrapping in blender","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md","fileName":"Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Live UV Unwrapping in Blender","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 01:18\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender UV Mapping and UDIM]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender UV Mapping and UDIM","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"live uv unwrapping in blender live uv unwrapping in blender","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md","fileName":"Live UV Unwrapping in Blender.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Live UV Unwrapping in Blender","heading":"Live UV Unwrapping in Blender","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Live Unwrap recalculates the UV layout as the artist edits seams or moves pinned UV vertices. The three-dimensional mesh and two-dimensional islands update together, shortening the cycle between a topology decision and its texture-space consequence.\n\nPinned vertices provide anchors while the remaining coordinates relax around them. The workflow is most useful when seam placement and island proportions need iterative refinement rather than a single automatic unwrap followed by unrelated manual edits.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender UV Mapping and UDIM","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Liv